{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome join the QQ Group 1062830120 for discussing\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa sold all her magical props for money in order to play 'Kappachinko', but ultimately lost anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa, who had stolen all over Gensokyo, was chased by unknown people and had to join the recent popular magic item battle...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Marisa will not give up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her excellent intuition for magical props (as well as the malicious loans of Reimu), she will defeat all opponents in battle and use all the money she steals to repay her debts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if she fail in the battle, welcoming Marisa may not be a good thing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/a44b238183e0a85dd3ea03b2ecd53a87.poster.avif?t=1762241380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/a44b238183e0a85dd3ea03b2ecd53a87.webm?t=1762241380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of Marissa, collect various items and combine them within ten days, and use these item to join the battle at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a complete game of about 20 minutes, you will face a large number of choices, and gradually forming your own structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, you will be mercilessly tested by the enemy, and if you fail to win, you will have to accept punishment...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ITEMS&amp;SKILLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 125 items and 48 skills, allowing players to freely combine them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, you can obtain different items and skills, unleash your imagination, and combine various powerful lineups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you can occasionally change the effects of some items, thus developing paths that even the production team never imagined!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/bb25b18d3287c69cfc6a3a2e3f3e0e1e.poster.avif?t=1762241380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/bb25b18d3287c69cfc6a3a2e3f3e0e1e.webm?t=1762241380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVENT CHOICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you can choose events three times, which can allow you to purchase items, gain skills, or increase experience, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some rare event, you can change the effects of items, thus developing paths that even the production team never imagined!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRA MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After playing several games, you can activate Extra mode to challenge your past history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Extra mode also allows you to import other people's game data. You can send your save file to your friends and let them experience your builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/c3ee38184cc93426ecac145c6b14b3f3.poster.avif?t=1762241380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/c3ee38184cc93426ecac145c6b14b3f3.webm?t=1762241380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/c3ee38184cc93426ecac145c6b14b3f3.mp4?t=1762241380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE THING...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize the background fo battles! Put your favorite stickers on it as decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are still many little secrets waiting for you to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome join the QQ Group 1062830120 for discussing\uff01</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950050?t=1762241380","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/43250827cc5777009f5a4e9e5d4fabb4e057bfad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762241380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/cd364a73fc4014a764a302085f8dd989633f5d68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762241380","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/cd364a73fc4014a764a302085f8dd989633f5d68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762241380","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome join the QQ Group 1062830120 for discussing\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa sold all her magical props for money in order to play 'Kappachinko', but ultimately lost anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa, who had stolen all over Gensokyo, was chased by unknown people and had to join the recent popular magic item battle...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Marisa will not give up!</p